# Test after major changes

After any major change (sim, map gen, combat, objectives, UI wiring to actions, lore that affects win/order checks), always run before considering the work done:

1. `npm run build`
2. `npm run playtest:smoke`

If the change touches win conditions, sector transitions, inventory/quest items, or autopilot behavior, also run:

3. `npm run playtest`

Do not skip these between major edits. Fix failures before moving on. Report pass/fail summary to the user.

After tests pass, commit the coherent change set before starting the next major change (see `commit-between-changes` rule).
